// OptIR vector operation to LIR Vec128/Vec256 instruction lowering, target SIMD legalization,
// narrow 64-bit MOVQ/MOVSD promotion, 256-bit -> 2x128-bit splitting, and VZEROUPPER insertion (T618 / E15.5).
// Implements SPEC-74 §6.5 (AXS-VEC-048, REQ-OPT-216, REQ-OPT-217) and SPEC-43 (AXS-SBE-001..022).
module compiler.lir.vec_lower

